       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "30260988"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Was identified as interaction partner for CCS (PubMed:30260988). Only misfolded mutant protein forms that lack part of the zinc-binding sites interact with CCS. The full-length protein does not interact with CCS. Likewise, mutant protein that lacks all four zinc-binding residues does not interact with CCS (PubMed:30260988)"
    }
   ],
